    <div class="body">
        <ul>
            <li>Student ID: 24-1217</li>
            <li>Program: BSIT</li>
            <li>Year Level: 3rd Year</li>
            <li>Email Address: bingil.sa@southernchristiancollege.edu.ph</li>
